WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.200
We have stored the ETag since day one.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.200
And never once sent it back.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.000
A page the origin confirms is dated now.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.700
304 is a 3xx, so the answer is a type.

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.200
A validator belongs to one URL only.

6
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.700
And nothing at all bounded the run.

7
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.300
Sixty-four requests for one question.

8
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.100
Running out is our doing, never theirs.

9
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.300
Asking whether it changed.
